# ops-analytics

Loaders and corrections for Tarnfield's operational data, shared by the services that report on it. Owned by
@tarnfield/ops-analytics; ask in #ops-analytics.

Released to the internal package index; services pin a version (`ops-analytics==0.7.2`). To change something, open a
PR in tarnfield/ops-analytics. Once it is released, bump the pin in the service.

## Modules

- `ops_analytics.wms2024`: the 2024 dispatch log from the old WMS, with our corrections applied (re-exported rows,
  known bad rows). The year-on-year SLA numbers are built from it.
- `ops_analytics.weeks`: week arithmetic for the weekly ops pack.
